    "detail": {
      "id": 1002004,
      "name": "Double Espresso",
      "desc": "Severian has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Double Espresso]</color>.\nDouble Espresso：When Severian uses a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color>, the accumulated <color=#FFFFFF>Flow</color> increases to 50.\nWhen Severian switches in through <color=#FFFFFF>Entry Skill: Clear Out</color>, the skill is replaced with a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color>. The entry type is not changed, and it is treated as a non-heavy attack. This effect can trigger once every 60s.\nEach time Severian uses <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Azure Wind's Shadowhunt</color>, he gains 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Windborne</color>.\nWhen Severian's attacks hit a target, they ignore 15% of the target's Wind RES.",
